{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@objc","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"colorCheckInteraction","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@OUDSTokensSemantic@objc(cs)MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"OUDSThemesOrange","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"title":"colorCheckInteraction","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B34ThemeSwitchComponentTokensProviderC21colorCheckInteraction18OUDSTokensSemantic013MultipleColorL5TokenCvp","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"colorCheckInteraction","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@OUDSTokensSemantic@objc(cs)MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSwitchComponentTokensProvider"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Has for value token colors.contentDefault (= light: “#000000FF” \/ dark: “#EEEEEEFF”)","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSwitchComponentTokensProvider\/colorCheckInteraction","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeswitchcomponenttokensprovider\/colorcheckinteraction"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"ic_theme_orange.png":{"type":"image","alt":null,"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png"}],"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"},"doc://OUDSTokensSemantic/documentation/OUDSTokensSemantic/MultipleColorSemanticToken":{"url":"\/documentation\/oudstokenssemantic\/multiplecolorsemantictoken","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A semantic token that wraps a combination of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/ColorSemanticToken","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" values based on the color scheme (light or dark mode)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Kind of composite token with multiple values, but not named “composite” because this word is already used in the design system."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Allows to gather the multiple-value tokens from "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Figma","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" inside one object."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If a color token has a value that depends on the color scheme, it must be packed in a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeSwitchComponentTokensProvider":{"kind":"symbol","title":"OrangeThemeSwitchComponentTokensProvider","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeSwitchComponentTokensProvider"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeswitchcomponenttokensprovider","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of switch"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"switch \/ toggle"}]},{"type":"text","text":" objects like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSwitchComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSwitchComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwitchComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"switch \/ toggle"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Switch","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens of colors (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spaces (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpacesSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":") ,  dimensions ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllDimensionSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sizes ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"), borders ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":") and opacities ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllOpacitiySemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSwitchComponentTokensProvider","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeSwitchComponentTokensProvider"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","role":"collection","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Theme Orange","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Theme Orange","images":[{"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","type":"icon"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeSwitchComponentTokensProvider/colorCheckInteraction":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSwitchComponentTokensProvider\/colorCheckInteraction","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeswitchcomponenttokensprovider\/colorcheckinteraction","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Has for value token colors.contentDefault (= light: “#000000FF” \/ dark: “#EEEEEEFF”)"}],"title":"colorCheckInteraction","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"colorCheckInteraction","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@OUDSTokensSemantic@objc(cs)MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}}}